' 4-2 第 10 頁：請 Agent 畫圖。這張圖本身也是一個 domain story：人口述，Agent 寫句子與文字檔，工具產圖，人讀圖再回到句子修改。
@startuml w42-agent-draws
!include <DomainStory/domainStory>
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang TC"
Person(person, 講師)
System(agent, Agent)
System(tool, 產圖工具)
Conversation(talk, 口述的一次工作)
Document(sentences, 活動句)
Document(puml, 文字檔)
Document(diagram, 圖)
activity(_, person, 說出, talk, 交給, agent)
activity(_, agent, 依口述列出, sentences, 交回, person)
activity(_, person, 逐句修改, sentences)
activity(_, agent, 依活動句寫成, puml, 交給, tool)
activity(_, tool, 讀取文字檔產出, diagram, 交回, person)
activity(_, person, 通讀圖後指出不通順的, sentences)
@enduml
